        "subject": "LU-20857 tests: except conf-sanity/125 on 2.16.50+ clients",
        "message": "LU-20857 tests: except conf-sanity/125 on 2.16.50+ clients\n\nDo not run conf-sanity.sh test_125 in interop testing when clients\nare older than v2_16_50-172-g52dcb6d72eb to avoid test failures\ndue to l_tunedisk no longer changing `max_sectors_kb`.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=conf-sanity env=ONLY=125,HONOR_EXCEPT=y\nFixes: 52dcb6d72e96 (\"LU-12029 utils: remove max_sectors_kb tuning\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ie68e5c09f07ccae575ce4dcb66075cbccd3d45e5\n"
